+now route to the EVEX arm (`vpinsrd $1,%r22d,...` was rejected; GAS
+accepts; note vpinsrb/w with EGPR byte/word regs are rejected by BOTH —
+kept), and `enclv` encoded 0F01E0 = SMSW %eax (now 0F01C0 per SDM).
